Z||000008||FieroKyle||07-20-2001||02:59 AM||||For some reason, I truly believe that the Pontiac Fiero is one of the most beloved cars during the 80's. Sure there were fires and stuff, but there is just something about these little shits that make me love them so much. :::tear, snuff:::: I guess there is one of these little guys in all of us.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sign_1.jpg">  <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>AOL Name: Yakty Yak<BR>E-Mail: YaktyYak@aol.com<P>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
