Z||000010||k2m4||07-20-2001||10:09 AM||||Geez, Its almost a love hate relationship. i love my 2 pigs as i call them. I hate when they break down but theres no better feeling when your done working on it starting it up and just cruising around with it smiling inside knowing you fixed it and not someone else. i admire them ...from the shitiest 2m4 to the prettiest GT they are all special. man i sound soo sappy right now but the fiero was my first new car. My sister bought me a brand new 86 when i was 16 and since then ive owned numerous and when my 2 die i will ressurect or buy another. i mean just look at them, they have face that you just cant resist!!.<P>------------------<BR>Kerm<BR>86 2M4<BR>86 1/2 GT||||reg||1
