Z||000014||Steve Normington||07-20-2001||02:25 PM||||A. Because so many people seem to have negative opinions of Fieros; I like to be contrary.<BR>B. My first ever car was a Fiero, so I have a soft spot for them (in my head).<BR>C. If I quit now, that means that the gods of entropy have won.<BR>D. I like to drive like I stole it.<BR>E. It just looks so damned good.||||reg||1
Z||000015||1FST2M6||07-20-2001||02:32 PM||||it's lack of monthly payment! i'll drop $350 a month on a new car or that on my Fiero and have somthing differnt and just as nice.<P>and WTF.. ok.. just got a new 01 Turbo Beetle for my wife ok.. $23k and some change.. my FIERO insurance is more expensive than her NEW Turbo Bug.. what the hell!! we are both insured on 4 cars on our policy and are really puzzled...  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fsthydrantsig.jpg">         <BR>www.engineered.net||||reg||1
