Z||000018||Master_Sushi||07-20-2001||03:35 PM||||I was seriously going to sell my fiero when I broke down near Toronto during rush hour  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">. One of the biggest reasons I keep my fiero is because if I sold it I'd lose allot of money. Mines in almost mint shape, and finding a really nice fiero is getting harder everyday. They are also very easy to work on, I like the non-rusting body. It's also fun telling people you drive a mid engine 2 seat sports car. ||||reg||2
