Z||000029||Mach10||07-21-2001||05:55 PM||||My Fiero sings to me when I'm running it. It winks and smiles at me when I polish it, and it can be a *****  to get up in the morning. Just like me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>If I love a car, I'll keep it running. If I hate it, I'll drive it into the ground. I love my Fiero, keeping it running is all part of the game. If nothing else, it's a hobby. If it never broke down, I wouldn't know as much about it as I do  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
