Z||000031||IndySid||07-22-2001||05:15 AM||||There are days (when I run into problems, especially electrical) I could sell it for a nickel  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> .  Then, there are days when it's running so good you couldn't pry my *ss out of the seat with a big ol Johnson bar!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  At first I thought I was the only one with this weird relationship with my car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> .  But after reading this thread it's good to see I'm not alone.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/indysid/TMP17.JPG" TARGET=_blank><BR>http://www.geocities.com/indysid/TMP17.JPG</A> <BR>All I want is a little more power!||||reg||1
